{"ref":"BDB, עַזְרִיקָם","hw":"עַזְרִיקָם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַזְרִיקָם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> Εζρεικαν, Εζρικαμ, etc.:<br><strong>1.</strong>  decendant of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.23\">1 Ch 3:23</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  prince in Judah <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.7\">2 Ch 28:7</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.38\">1 Ch 8:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.44\">9:44</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  Levite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.14\">9:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.15\">Ne 11:15</a>.","next":"BDB, יַעְזֵר²","prev":"BDB, עֶזְרִי"}